Obtained value of the fitting parameter is: \(A\) = 1.42 \(\pm\) 0.04. So, the rapidity weight is:

\[w_{y}^{J/\psi}=\exp(-\frac{0.5y^{2}}{1.416^{2}}) \tag{3.7}\]

A total input weight, \(w_{input}^{J/\psi}\), is a product of the \(p_{T}\) weight the and \(y\) weight:

